        "filing_date": "2025-11-07",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a provider of services to financial institutions, portions of our business are subject to obligations to comply with certain GLBA provisions, including limitations on the use or disclosure of the underlying data and rules relating to the technological, physical and administrative safeguarding of non-public personal information.",
