        "filing_date": "2025-11-07",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Except for product development using de-personalized data, FICO does not collect or store the consumer credit data used in the calculation of our scores, and in most cases, we do not sell our scores directly to lenders or other end-users.",
